        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Screening estimate from a photo-based sample using IBMWP family scores (Alba-Tercedor et al. (2002), family scores as in MAGRAMA (2011)), banded on IASPT; not a Water Framework Directive classification. A formal classification needs a standardised kick sample, laboratory identification and comparison against a reference site."
          },
          {
            "text": "Sensitive animals are thinning out. Something is putting the stream under pressure."
          },
          {
            "text": "A vision model, shown the sample photograph without the observer's identifications, independently agreed on 1 of them; the observer kept their own identification on 1 after comparing."
          },
          {
            "text": "Limitations: 8 habitat question(s) went unanswered (water_colour, foam_or_sheen, litter, riparian_vegetation, bank_modification, substrate, sediment_deposit, shade), so the pressure score covers less of the site; 4 of 12 habitat questions were answered; each unanswered one leaves part of the site undescribed"
          }
